ecome fortune-tellers,\ncasting spells with herbs and wax images.\nBut come—Cain and his thorns\nalready straddle the boundary\nof both hemispheres, and below Seville\nthe moon touches the ocean waves.\nLast night it was already full—\nyou should remember it did you no harm\nback in the deep forest.\"","startTime":271.38,"endTime":338.02,"words":[{"word":"\"The","start":271.38,"end":271.62},{"word":"one","start":271.62,"end":271.86},{"word":"whose","start":271.86,"end":272.18},{"word":"beard","start":272.18,"end":272.66},{"word":"spreads","start":272.66,"end":273.14},{"word":"from","start":273.14,"end":273.3},{"word":"his","start":273.3,"end":273.62},{"word":"cheek","start":273.62,"end":274.02},{"word":"across","start":274.02,"end":274.42},{"word":"his","start":274.42,"end":274.66},{"word":"dark","start":274.66,"end":274.98},{"word":"shoulders","start":274.98,"end":275.86},{"word":"was","start":275.86,"end":276.1},{"word":"an","start":276.1,"end":276.34},{"word":"augur","start":276.34,"end":276.98},{"word":"when","start":276.98,"end":277.22},{"word":"Greece","start":277.22,"end":277.62},{"word":"was","start":277.62,"end":277.86},{"word":"emptied","start":277.86,"end":278.26},{"word":"of","start":278.26,"end":278.42},{"word":"men,","start":278.42,"end":279.38},{"word":"scarcely","start":279.38,"end":279.94},{"word":"a","start":279.94,"end":280.1},{"word":"male","start":280.1,"end":280.5},{"word":"child","start":280.5,"end":280.98},{"word":"left","start":280.98,"end":281.34},{"word":"in","start":281.34,"end":281.58},{"word":"any","start":281.58,"end":281.78},{"word":"cradle.","start":281.78,"end":282.98},{"word":"With","start":282.98,"end":283.22},{"word":"Calchas","start":283.22,"end":284.1},{"word":"he","start":284.1,"end":284.34},{"word":"chose","start":284.34,"end":284.66},{"word":"the","start":284.66,"end":284.9},{"word":"moment","start":284.9,"end":285.14},{"word":"at","start":285.14,"end":285.3},{"word":"Aulis","start":285.3,"end":285.86},{"word":"to","start":2